                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "23e16df8-59c6-3187-a6c9-67c50fd0d429",
                        "entry_id": "e42346fd-f916-3ff3-8c20-6e7a675930d2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "twilight, semi-darkness, shade"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bf091cd1-9673-41ba-8c1b-3971c9b53c2f",
                                "sense_id": "23e16df8-59c6-3187-a6c9-67c50fd0d429",
                                "text": "Се́рый, ро́вный, засты́вший полумра́к спуска́лся с тё́много не́ба, и я не знал, когда́ су́мерки перешли́ в ве́чер и ве́чер перешё́л в ночь, и ду́мал, что всё э́то была́ одна́ до́лгая ночь.",
                                "translation": "The grey, uniform, frozen semi-darkness descended from the lightless sky, and I was not conscious of when the twilight passed into evening, and when the evening passed into night—to me it was all one long night.",
                                "english": "The grey, uniform, frozen semi-darkness descended from the lightless sky, and I was not conscious of when the twilight passed into evening, and when the evening passed into night—to me it was all one long night."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
